ity Options<\/h3>\n                    <p>Games developed with scalability in focus allow seamless expansion, whether you're adding multiplayer functionality, new levels, or transitioning to new platforms like iOS game development or Android game development. Our modular design methodology ensures long-term flexibility. Much like the responsive frameworks used in mobile development, we create infrastructure that grows with your user base and content roadmap.<\/p>\n                <\/div>\n\n                <div class=\"child-c cc3\">\n                    <h3>Absolute Process Transparency<\/h3>\n                    <p>Throughout the game development lifecycle, we maintain open, structured communication with our clients. From early-stage wireframes to deployment timelines, every milestone is tracked, shared, and approved collaboratively. This level of transparency is essential to the agile workflows often seen in both mobile game development and complex business applications.<\/p>\n                <\/div>\n\n                <div class=\"child-c cc4\">\n                    <h3>Cost-Effective Pricing Models Options<\/h3>\n                    <p>Working with an experienced team allows you to balance quality with budget. We offer flexible pricing models that align with the scope, scale, and duration of your project. Whether you're launching a small mobile game or a full-scale video game development project, our pricing structures, like those used in enterprise development, are designed to provide maximum value without compromising quality or delivery timelines.<\/p>\n                <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n    const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');\n    const contents = document.querySelectorAll('.child-c');\n\n    function clearActiveStates() {\n        tabs.forEach(tab => tab.classList.remove('scrolled'));\n        contents.forEach(content =