section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5fb47ef\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3e00b1f\" data-id=\"3e00b1f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16120ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"16120ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQ\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea17f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"ea17f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t        <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-ea17f58\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"ea17f58\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n    <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"how-much-does-it-cost-to-develop-a-game\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header active-default\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2451\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How much does it cost to develop a game?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm144 276c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-92v92c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-56c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-92h-92c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-56c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h92v-92c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h56c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v92h92c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v56z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2451\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix active-default\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"how-much-does-it-cost-to-develop-a-game\"><p>The cost of game development depends on several factors, including game type, design complexity, feature set, and target platforms. Simple mobile game development projects can range from $10,000 to $30,000, while high-end 3D game development or VR game development solutions may exceed $100,000. Costs also vary based on asset creation, multiplayer integration, and backend infrastructure.<\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"what-is-game-development\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2452\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Is Game Development?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm144 276c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-92v92c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-56c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-92h-92c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-56c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h92v-92c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h56c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v92h92c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v56z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2452\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"what-is-game-development\"><p>Game development is the process of creating interactive digital experiences using a blend of storytelling, mechanics, design, and programming. It applies across multiple formats, including video game development, iOS game development, and Android game development, and requires a clear understanding of user engagement, platform standards, and performance goals.<\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"what-technologies-are-you-using-in-game-development\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2453\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What technologies are you using in game development?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm144 276c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-92v92c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-56c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-92h-92c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-56c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h92v-92c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h56c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v92h92c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v56z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2453\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"what-technologies-are-you-using-in-game-development\"><p>Our team works with Unity, Unreal Engine, C#, and custom scripting environments to deliver high-performance games. We tailor our tech stack depending on whether the project involves mobile game development services, real-time VR game development, or multi-platform delivery, ensuring functionality, speed, and scalability.<\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"how-long-does-it-take-to-develop-a-video-game\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2454\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How long does it take to develop a video game?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm144 276c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-92v92c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-56c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-92h-92c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-56c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h92v-92c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h56c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v92h92c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v56z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2454\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-long-does-it-take-to-develop-a-video-game\"><p>Development timelines vary based on project scope. A basic mobile game may take around 3 to 6 months, while larger 3D game development projects can extend over a year. Each stage from discovery and pre-production to testing and launch, affects the timeline. We\u2019ve shared common timelines and production considerations in our game development<a href=\"https:\/\/digitalsoftwarelabs.com\/blogs\/\"> blog<\/a>, where different project types and build approaches are reflected through real production examples.<\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>GAME DEVELOPMENT Services Game Development Services As one of the experienced teams in game development services, we ensure each game is thoughtfully designed, market-ready, and aligned with your vision. Our expertise spans mobile game development, 3D game development, and unity game development, with a focus on delivering seamless performance across devices. From casual puzzle games [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-9562","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"rankMath":{"parentDomain":"digitalsoftwarelabs.com","noFollowDomains":[],"noFollowExcludeDomains":[],"noFollowExternalLinks":false,"featuredImageNotice":"The featured image should be at least 200 by 200 pixels to be picked up by Facebook and othe